1
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,300
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:46,720
[Episode 2]

3
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:47,250
[Adapted from Migu’s novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gujun]

5
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:58,760
Thank you, Mr. Zhuo.

6
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,040
Get home safe.

7
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,000
Shu Tinglan.

8
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,680
What happens when a stone

9
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,759
breaks the stillness?

10
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,660
Turn off the lights first.

11
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:14,080
Tinglan.

12
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,640
What's wrong?

13
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,970
I have something to handle at work.

14
00:03:20,050 --> 00:03:20,720
I have to go.

15
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:22,079
Um, I'm okay.

16
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,920
You should go.

17
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,120
Oh, right.

18
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,400
Lock the door on your way out.

19
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,860
I never thought I'd see him again.

20
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,160
Will we

21
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,680
ever meet again?

22
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,040
Hello?

23
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,320
Ms. Shu.

24
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,890
Your mother is missing.

25
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,040
What?

26
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:06,240
Mom.

27
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,440
Mom!

28
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,360
Tinglan.

29
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,760
Mom.

30
00:04:22,710 --> 00:04:23,550
You slut!

31
00:04:23,570 --> 00:04:23,960
Mom!

32
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,520
- You homewrecker!
- Mom!

33
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,200
- Why did you seduce my husband?
- Mom!

34
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,890
- Why did you ruin our family?
- It's me, Mom!

35
00:04:28,890 --> 00:04:30,840
You shameless woman!

36
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,880
You slut!

37
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,440
Mom.

38
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,040
You ruined my life!

39
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,040
Mom.

40
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,720
I'm Tinglan.

41
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:40,080
- I’m Tinglan!
- You shameless woman!

42
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:40,710
Mom.

43
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,840
I'm Tinglan.

44
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:45,490
Mom.

45
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,240
I'm Tinglan.

46
00:04:47,890 --> 00:04:48,640
Mom.

47
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,640
Mom.

48
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,760
Tinglan.

49
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,600
Tinglan.

50
00:04:55,710 --> 00:04:57,840
I got mixed up again, didn't I?

51
00:04:58,150 --> 00:04:59,080
No.

52
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:02,360
I'm a burden to you again, Tinglan.

53
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,880
Mom.

54
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:10,760
You'll never be a burden to me.

55
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:15,600
It's windy out here.

56
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,640
Let's head back, okay?

57
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,080
Okay.

58
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,440
Mom's illness

59
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,740
and the debts Dad left behind.

60
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,520
That's my life.

61
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,720
I'm sorry about the trouble tonight.

62
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:57,720
Ms. Shu,

63
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,240
we're only doing our job.

64
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,820
But the bill can't wait any longer.

65
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:04,160
I know. I'll pay it as soon as I can.

66
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,280
Okay.

67
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,520
[Zhuo Yu'an]

68
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:46,159
Everything with Zhuo Yu'an tonight

69
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,720
felt like a Cinderella story.

70
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:50,960
At midnight,

71
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,920
the ball ended.

72
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,730
It's time to return to my real life.

73
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:08,810
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

74
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:08,980
Morning, Shu.

75
00:07:08,980 --> 00:07:09,960
Good morning.

76
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:17,800
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

77
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:15,720
Last night,

78
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,560
Zhuoyuan Technology's

79
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,300
unreleased smart home system

80
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,720
suffered a major data breach.

81
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,320
Zhuoyuan Technology.

82
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,000
That's Zhuo Yu'an's company.

83
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,920
Mr. Zhuo! Mr. Zhuo!

84
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,460
Can you give us an update?

85
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,840
Please answer the question.

86
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,160
Mr. Zhuo! Mr. Zhuo!

87
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,159
Please say something, Mr. Zhuo.

88
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,159
Stop filming.

89
00:07:34,159 --> 00:07:35,600
Mr. Zhuo! Mr. Zhuo!

90
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,040
So he really left last night

91
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,640
to deal with work.

92
00:07:40,659 --> 00:07:42,780
This data breach is a major case.

93
00:07:42,290 --> 00:07:43,650
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

94
00:07:43,159 --> 00:07:44,600
It could lead to a long-term deal

95
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:47,040
with Zhuoyuan Technology.

96
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,200
I want

97
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,780
Hongzheng Law Firm to land this case.

98
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:53,440
Our biggest challenge right now

99
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:55,480
is reaching Zhuoyuan Technology.

100
00:07:57,750 --> 00:08:00,250
[Zhuoyuan Technology, Zhuo Yu'an]

101
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,720
Zhuo Yu'an is hard to win over.

102
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:01,920
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

103
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,080
He just came back from abroad.

104
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,400
No one in the industry knows

105
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,520
who he's close to.

106
00:08:08,550 --> 00:08:09,280
Xiao.

107
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,120
I can do it.

108
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:12,080
My dad has worked

109
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,960
with Zhuoyuan Technology before.

110
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,620
I can try reaching out to them.

111
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,240
Ms. Shu,

112
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,720
the bill can't wait any longer.

113
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,020
Director Xiao.

114
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:26,280
Mr. Zhuo and I went
to the same high school.

115
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,520
I can try too.

116
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,240
Do you think Shu Tinglan

117
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,700
can really reach Mr. Zhuo?

118
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,000
Her?

119
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,520
She's a junior associate
who's never handled a case.

120
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,559
And now she thinks she can land it?

121
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,480
She'll only embarrass herself.

122
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,140
Just wait. This should be fun.

123
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,320
Why watch a rehearsal?

124
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:47,210
I'd rather go play basketball.

125
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,120
I'm just looking around.

126
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,880
Can she even pull this off?

127
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:27,040
The show's about to start.

128
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:22,200
Hey.

129
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,440
You were really good.

130
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,680
Nice recovery.

131
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,610
Let's go.

132
00:11:28,290 --> 00:11:30,040
What class is she in?

133
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,280
She was really good.

134
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,480
Why are you just clapping?

135
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,010
If you like her, ask her out.

136
00:11:37,950 --> 00:11:39,240
Leave her alone.

137
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,280
Leave her alone. You're no fun.
